# =====================
# AUTH
# =====================

### Register
POST http://18.191.166.24:3000/api/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@studyspots.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Login
POST http://18.191.166.24:3000/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@studyspots.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Refresh Access Token (paste refresh token from login)
POST http://18.191.166.24:3000/api/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE"
}

###

### Logout (invalidates refresh token)
DELETE http://18.191.166.24:3000/api/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE"
}

###


# =====================
# CC-2 PREFERENCE MATCHING
# =====================

### CC-2 Happy Path - Low noise + Wifi + Seating + Outlets
POST http://18.191.166.24:3000/api/locations/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "noise_preference": "low",
  "amenities": ["Wifi", "Seating", "Outlets"]
}

###

### CC-2 Happy Path - High noise + Coffee + Food
POST http://18.191.166.24:3000/api/locations/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "noise_preference": "high",
  "amenities": ["Coffee", "Food"]
}

###

### CC-2 Happy Path - Medium noise
POST http://18.191.166.24:3000/api/locations/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "noise_preference": "medium",
  "amenities": ["Wifi"]
}

###

### CC-2 Edge Case - No matching locations
POST http://18.191.166.24:3000/api/locations/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "noise_preference": "low",
  "amenities": ["Food", "Drinks"]
}

###

### CC-2 Error - Missing noise_preference
POST http://18.191.166.24:3000/api/locations/search
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###


